<title>GERMANY: Preussag Stahl cuts 95/96 dividend.</title>
<headline>Preussag Stahl cuts 95/96 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SALZGITTER, Germany 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business year to September 30, 1996 (In millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>  Dividend  (marks)			 15.00    vs 25</p>
<p>  Net income				  60.23    vs 125.73</p>
<p>  Capital stock			    312.00    vs 312.00</p>
<p>  Dividend amount			   46.80    vs  78.00</p>
<p>  Balance carried forward		 13.43    vs  47.73</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Preussag Stahl AG. The dividend is payable on the first business day after the company's general meeting on March 1.</p>
</text>
